      ],
      "source": "https://patagoniaregionaltimes.org/glimpses-from-our-past-the-babocomari-creek-bridge/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Elgin pioneered Arizona’s commercial‑scale winemaking in the 1970s after a soil scientist noted its Burgundy‑like soil.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
